msgstr "Tage"

msgid ""
"Counted from the launch of each campaign. Late people are reminded by email "
"once a week; nothing else happens to them."
msgstr ""
"Ab dem Start jeder Kampagne gezählt. Säumige Personen werden einmal pro "
"Woche per E-Mail erinnert, ohne weitere Folgen."

msgid "Acknowledgement campaign"
msgstr "Kenntnisnahme-Kampagne"

