msgstr "Alle vorgeschlagenen Anforderungen sind bereits in der Checkliste."

msgid ""
"ISMS requirements (clauses 4 to 10), applicable Annex A controls of the "
"statement of applicability, and requirements of the enabled custom "
"frameworks. Requirements already in the checklist are not offered again."
msgstr ""
"ISMS-Anforderungen (Abschnitte 4 bis 10), anwendbare Maßnahmen des Anhangs A "
