msgstr "Zurück zu den Tests von %s"

msgid "Recorded as a test"
msgstr "Als Test erfasst"

msgid "Test record for the auditor (PDF)"
msgstr "Testnachweis für den Auditor (PDF)"

msgid "Population and criteria"
msgstr "Grundgesamtheit und Kriterien"

msgid "How the sample was drawn"
msgstr "Wie die Stichprobe gezogen wurde"

msgid "once every item is checked"
msgstr "sobald jedes Element geprüft ist"

